sequenceDiagram
  participant T as jobhunt.timer
  participant D as Discovery worker
  participant S as Public job sources
  participant R as Ranking pipeline
  participant B as Review board
  T->>D: Start scheduled discovery
  D->>S: Fetch public listings
  S-->>D: Listing metadata
  D->>R: Normalize and score
  R->>B: Store review candidates
  B-->>R: Human decision
